{"case_id":"seeded-werkzeug-debugger-pin-check","kind":"seeded","sample":0,"findings":[{"id":"F1","title":"Removal of authentication and trust checks before command execution","category":"security","severity":"critical","confidence":"high","anchor":{"path":"src/werkzeug/debug/__init__.py","side":"RIGHT","start_line":560,"end_line":561},"explanation":"The checks for `self.secret == secret` and `self.check_pin_trust(environ)` were removed from `__call__` under the assumption that `execute_command` checks that the request is trusted. If `execute_command` does not adequately verify pin trust or secrets independently for all evaluation paths, this could allow arbitrary code execution via the debugger without proper authentication.","suggested_fix":"Ensure that `execute_command` or the conditional dispatch explicitly validates the security token and pin trust before executing debugger commands.","anchor_in_diff":true,"evidence":[]}],"matches":[{"finding_id":"F1","issue_id":"rce-without-pin","distance":0,"verdict":"match","rationale":"location-only matching"}],"expected_total":1,"decoy_hits":[],"review_usage":{"input_tokens":1230,"output_tokens":264,"thinking_tokens":0,"cached_input_tokens":0},"judge_usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"thinking_tokens":0,"cached_input_tokens":0},"cached":false,"requests":1,"cached_requests":0,"agent":null,"duration_seconds":61.128,"error":null}
